#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_config_settings__reservation_invoice_block_policy
msgid ""
"When to block validating (posting) a reservation's regular invoice. 'Do not "
"block' disables the lock; 'Not before check-in' blocks reservations arriving"
" in the future; 'Not before check-out' blocks stays that have not departed "
"yet; 'Custom domain' uses the domain below. Draft invoices can always be "
"created; down payment invoices are never blocked."
msgstr ""

